.TH tutac n 0.1 tclutils
.SH tclutils::tutac
.PP
\fBtac\fR\-like reversal of line order (pure Tcl).
.SS API
.CS
::tclutils::tutac::text text
::tclutils::tutac::file path
::tclutils::tutac::lines lineList
.CE
.PP
A trailing newline is preserved (so \fBa\enb\en\fR becomes \fBb\ena\en\fR).
.SS CLI
.CS
tclsh bin/tutac.tcl file.txt
.CE
